Z||000000||Xtreme Fiero's||12-18-2000||11:14 PM||||<BR>Ok this I pissing me off, It all started a few months ago I met a guy with a gold 86 V6 SE at a pool hall in baltimore leaking water all over he says he is selling it for $800 I get his Phone # and I go out & get wasted and loose the # DOH!!!! about a week later I see a Black 85 GT for sale on the forum for $1500 it's fairly tricked out and seems like a good deal (Blown clutch[owner thinks trans]) the owner turns out to be a Retarded monkey DOH!!!! and now I found another black 85 GT (no motor) hard top at that for $500 i'm like hells yeha but no go it's in SC and I can find a towing company to come on this side of the mississippi DOH!!!!<P>Dose this happen to evrey body?||||reg||8
